ve experiences.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Should my pet's name match their breed heritage?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"It's a personal choice with no right or wrong answer. Breed-heritage names (like 'Angus' for a Scottish Terrier or 'Sakura' for a Shiba Inu) add cultural meaning, but countless pets thrive with names that have no connection to their breed origins. Choose what resonates with you.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What if my family can't agree on a name?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Create a democratic process: each person nominates their top three names, create a combined shortlist, and vote. You can also try a tournament bracket where names compete head-to-head until a champion emerges. The key is giving everyone a voice while keeping the process fun.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Are two-word names practical?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Two-word names like 'Luna Mae' or 'Buddy Boo' can work beautifully, especially if you primarily use the first word for everyday calling and save the full name for formal moments. Consider whether both parts together roll off the tongue easily when called at a distance.\\\"}]]}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"4e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"ragamuffin\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/ragamuffin/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🐱\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Ragamuffin\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"dyeing-poison-frog\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/dyeing-poison-frog/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🐸\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Dyeing Poison Frog\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"clumber-spaniel\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/clumber-spaniel/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🐕\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hove